  abstract={Noncentrosymmetricity was identified in H<i>R</i>TiO₄ (R = Eu, Gd, Dy) layered oxides using second harmonic generation, synchrotron X-ray diffraction, and DFT calculations.
            Though previously thought to be centrosymmetric, inversion symmetry is broken by octahedral rotations.
